+<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1080" height="620" viewBox="0 0 1080 620" role="img" aria-labelledby="title desc">
+  <title id="title">By Rank 24, the Machine Cannot Be Filled</title>
+  <desc id="desc">A fixed 32 GB budget halves the resident workgroup pool as rank increases. Five gfx950 device maps show the pool shrinking from 2,048 workgroups at rank 20 to 168 workgroups at rank 24, leaving 88 of 256 CUs without a resident workgroup.</desc>
